{"title": "后端宕机，use_stale 返回过期缓存", "lines": [
  {"t": "note", "s": "sleep 4 让缓存过期，再 kill 掉后端进程："},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "kill -QUIT $(cat /srv/backend/logs/nginx.pid)"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -D - -o /dev/null \"localhost:8081/api/?id=1\" | grep X-Cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Cache-Status: STALE"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "DATA for id=1"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "回源必失败，旧缓存兜底而不是 502"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测：nginx:1.28-alpine 容器（TTL 3s）"}
]}
